Module endingsways "A drop with a way back, and three endings" {
  Place field "a field" is wilderness.
  Place ledge "the ledge" is room within field at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place pool "the still water" is room within field at 1, 0 outdoors.
  Passage drop "the drop" is path between ledge and pool taking 2 minutes one way.
  Passage stair "the cut stair" is path between pool and ledge taking 10 minutes one way.
  Company party "You" of 1 at ledge.
  Relation drowned(group). Relation saved(group). Relation sung(group).
  Ending drowning "The Drowning" when drowned(party) "The water closes over.".
  Ending ballad "The Ballad" when drowned(party) and sung(party) "They sing of it after.".
  Ending homecoming "The Keeping" when saved(party) "You come home.".
  Observe ledge_scene at ledge when true "A ledge over still water.".
  Observe pool_scene at pool when true "Still water under a ledge.".
  Goal false.
}
